  "name": "Doc IO Inbound Document Ingestion",
  "description": "Orchestration flow that automates end to end processing of inbound documents into Oracle systems. The workflow coordinates three specialized agents Unstructured Document Recognition, Structured Document Recognition, and Inbound Document Transformer to automatically recognize document types, extract and map data to Oracle schemas, enrich data quality and ingest.",
